### Activity 6: Bookmarks API requests
### Start the server first:
###   docker compose exec node node week07/class1/activity6/bookmarks_api.js

@base = http://localhost:3001

### List all bookmarks
GET {{base}}/api/bookmarks

### Get one (TODO 2)
GET {{base}}/api/bookmarks/1

### Get one that doesn't exist -> 404 (TODO 2)
GET {{base}}/api/bookmarks/999

### Add a valid bookmark -> 201 (TODO 3)
POST {{base}}/api/bookmarks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "MDN", "url": "https://developer.mozilla.org", "tags": ["reference"] }

### Invalid: empty title, url not http -> 400 (TODO 1 + 3)
POST {{base}}/api/bookmarks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "url": "ftp://nope" }

### Delete one -> 204 (TODO 4)
DELETE {{base}}/api/bookmarks/1

### Any unknown route -> 404 (TODO 5)
GET {{base}}/api/whatever
